# .NET build output — applies to every project at any depth
**/bin/
**/obj/

# EF Core generated migrations (adjust/remove if you DO want these in context)
**/Migrations/**/*.Designer.cs
**/*.Designer.cs

# Auto-generated source
**/*.g.cs
**/*.g.i.cs
**/AssemblyInfo.cs
**/GlobalAssemblyInfo.cs

# Test results / coverage
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# NuGet
**/packages/
**/*.nupkg

# Node (in case any project has a frontend)
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

# IDE / OS noise
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store